      "id": 496081,
      "username": "redbasil",
      "name": "Redbasil Support",
      "created_at": "2026-03-19T08:27:54.320Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello. We are new to ERPNext and are trying to setup GST to work at item / item-group level in version 16.</p>\n<p>I have been able to get all the basic GST rates to work, but unable to see any default configuration to apply the CESS %. Our business in in trading of various FMCG products, some of which (e.g. cold drinks) require 28% GST + 12% CESS.</p>\n<p>On searching this forum we found a couple of posts relevant to this topic, but the solution mentioned in that did not work for us.</p>\n<p>Can anyone provide insights how to add the CESS % to GST rates?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/74df32/{size}.png",
