      "id": 496117,
      "username": "Lakshit_Jain",
      "name": "Lakshit Jain",
      "created_at": "2026-03-19T12:25:37.766Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You have to specify Cess accounts in GST Settings and configure Taxes and Charges Template and Item Tax Template with the cess account.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a8fdcf6b9540565a68797880f286af087b99349e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a8fdcf6b9540565a68797880f286af087b99349e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a8fdcf6b9540565a68797880f286af087b99349e_2_690x410.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"o6Y03G12SlA5jmaVdMW5FSyeBXg\" width=\"690\" height=\"410\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a8fdcf6b9540565a68797880f286af087b99349e_2_690x410.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a8fdcf6b9540565a68797880f286af087b99349e_2_1035x615.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a8fdcf6b9540565a68797880f286af087b99349e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1332×792 59.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
